{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\"><transition event=\"go\" target=\"f\"/></state><state id=\"f\" type=\"final\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-state-type-final.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-state-type-final.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":5,"byteOffset":157,"endColumn":66,"endLine":2,"startColumn":61,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":"final"}},{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":13,"byteOffset":169,"endColumn":86,"endLine":2,"startColumn":73,"startLine":2},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"write the state as `<final>`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-state-type-final.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":78,"endLine":2,"startColumn":74,"startLine":2}}}],"message":{"markdown":"attribute `type` is not allowed on `<state>`\n\n**Note:** the W3C SCXML 1.0 schema rejects this under XML Schema constraint `cvc-complex-type.3.2.2`: Attribute 'type' is not allowed for this element\n\n**Help:** SCXML has no state `type` attribute: a final state is written as the element `<final>`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §3.3 <state>\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type) (`cvc-complex-type.3.2.2`)","text":"attribute `type` is not allowed on `<state>`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":174,"start":170},"category":"schema"},"ruleId":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.3.2.2"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML elements accept only their declared attributes; extension attributes must be namespace-qualified"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: correct the attribute name (an attribute of a related element becomes this element's own, such as `id` for `<cancel>`'s `sendid` on `<send>`), remove it, or qualify an extension attribute with a namespace prefix.\n\nSpecification: XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type)\n\nRun `scx --explain XSD-cvc-complex-type.3.2.2` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-1/#cvc-complex-type","id":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.3.2.2","name":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.3.2.2","properties":{"category":"schema"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an attribute is not declared for this element"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}